3	 *
4	 * Runs user-supplied scripts in an isolated Node `vm` context with deterministic
5	 * globals (Date/Math.random/timers shimmed to throw). The script gets a fixed
6	 * set of orchestration globals — `args`, `log`, `phase`, `budget`, `agent`,
