12	 *     → enabling collapses effort to `xhigh` and flips a sticky `ultracode` flag.
13	 *   - reminders: `ultra_effort_enter` (full | sparse) / `ultra_effort_exit`, all
14	 *     `isMeta`. Full on the enter turn; sparse every TURNS_BETWEEN_MAINTENANCE
