/**
 * Workflow TUI progress-tree rendering.
 *
 * Calls the real Workflow tool's renderResult with crafted details + an identity
 * theme, and asserts the live agent tree: per-agent status icons (running/done/
 * error/replayed), labels, model, durations, the phases line, and the big-run cap.
 *
 * Run: node test/render.test.mjs
